{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE9rehydrate4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxObservable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"role":"symbol","title":"rehydrate(into:policy:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rehydrate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Re-hydration that reconciles stored rows into the live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":"s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without dropping unflushed writes or in-progress edits (rule #8)."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MergePolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The live store to reconcile."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only. Pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemoteAdditive"},{"type":"text","text":" after a container rebuild,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where a row’s absence says nothing about whether it was deleted."}]}],"name":"policy"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes the store rather than ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout State"},{"text":" on purpose. Re-hydration is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mid-session operation with two ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"text":"s in it (the flush, then the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetches), and any caller holding a state snapshot across those would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overwrite everything dispatched in between. Here the flush and every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"fetch complete first; only then does one suspension-free step pack a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fresh snapshot, merge, and unpack."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under the default "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote"},{"type":"text","text":", remote edits and remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deletions surface mid-session. An ID is exempt whenever the local side"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still has something to say about it — a drained-but-unflushed write, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"un-drained edit, a pending deletion, or a write whose save failed. Those"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always win, and that guarantee is not configurable."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pending writes and deletions are flushed to disk ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the merge, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remote-change refresh that fires during the debounce window can’t read a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stale disk row for an entity the user just edited or deleted and resurrect","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it. The flush closes most of the window; the dirty set closes what the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remaining suspension points let through.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One case can’t be inferred — an edit still sitting in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view’s local ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"text":" has never reached the store, so a remote value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can land underneath it. Bindings made with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.binding(_:sending:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dispatch on write and are covered already. Otherwise declare the edit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","type":"reference"},{"text":" (see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds","type":"reference"},{"text":"), which exempts one ID for as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"long as it is being edited, or register a whole collection with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important","name":"Important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a fetch fails, the corresponding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is left untouched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the failure is reported via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onFailure"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If another merge commits during a read, the operation re-reads against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that newer state before applying anything. Replacing the database"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discards any reads still in flight against the previous container."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"references":{"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/EditingHolds":{"title":"EditingHolds","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/editingholds","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs an app has declared it is editing, exempt from a re-hydration merge for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as long as the hold is in force."}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceCoordinator/rehydrate(into:policy:)":{"title":"rehydrate(into:policy:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rehydrate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"tex